# Executive summary — Free Cash Competitions

**Prepared:** {{date}}
**Upstream dataset:** `karagemop466-tech/FreeMoneyApps`, `assets/data.js`, commit `{{upstreamcommit}}`, upstream review date {{upstreamdate}}
**Live site:** https://sassnarep3-star.github.io/Own3/
